        "text_zmXG7T": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Because we love Miami we want to take care of our city. \n\n</p><p>The purpose of this brand is to have an active role in helping Miami to be a sustainable city. Part of the company’s profit will be allocated to keep Miami County green supporting and creating initiatives to preserve our natural beauty.\n\n</p><p>So, every time you buy an I AM MIAMI product, you are contributing to making Miami County more sustainable.</p>",
